{{also|'specially}}
==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|special|ly|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-specially.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# For a [[special]] purpose.
#: ''We had this cake made '''specially''' for your birthday.
# {{lb|en|proscribed}} [[extremely]]
#: ''She's '''specially''' good at running.''
# {{lb|en|proscribed}} [[in particular]]
#: ''I love all animals, '''specially''' cute furry ones.''

====Usage notes====
* Senses 2 and 3 are non-standard; in such cases, {{m|en|especially}} is far more common, and considered correct.

